WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.160
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.160
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.580
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.580
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.370
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.370
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.550
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.550
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.470
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.470
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.020
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.020
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.310
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.310
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.690
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.690
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:44.200
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:44.200
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.530
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.530
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:53.910
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:53.910
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.880
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.880
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:03.090
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:03.090
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:07.090
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:07.090
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:12.180
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:12.180
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:17.150
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:17.150
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.900
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.900
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:23.240
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:23.240
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:39.920
THE TERRIFYING DRACONIC AURA

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.220
When this Dragon Crest shines,

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:58.600
my body is enveloped in a current of
life energy called a Draconic Aura.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:04.780
It's a Defense Shroud that hardens my body
like steel and repels all spells.

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:10.570
<i>I see. That explains it.</i>

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.830
<i>When that crest shined, Dai's body
became unbelievably hard.</i>

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:23.000
And when I fully deploy this Draconic Aura
and fight using its power...

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:31.680
no creature in the world can face me!

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.240
Dammit!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.710
Big Guy!

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.970
And now, you can no longer fight.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.220
Princess.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.220
Take care of Dai!

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:16.220
Got it!

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.860
<i>What a wound.</i>

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.150
<i>So this is what Gigabreak does.</i>

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:35.530
<i>Dai, hang in there!
You're a Hero, aren't you?!</i>

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:38.370
Surrender.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.080
Hold it!

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.380
Popp!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.550
What are you doing?

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:50.220
Magic doesn't work,
so I'll hit you with this!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.260
Don't be stupid, boy!

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:59.020
<i>I'm like a frog being glared at
by a snake! I feel paralyzed!</i>

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:07.360
The reason I thoroughly crushed Crocodine
is because his type is the most dangerous.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:14.530
The Draconic Aura repels all spells,
but a greater force or Aura can pierce it,

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.990
and damage my body.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:22.710
A-Are you sure you want
to give away your weakness like that?

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.540
Young fool.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:31.880
Crocodine is mighty. A strike from
a weak Mage like you will hardly tickle.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:35.470
In fact, your arm would likely break.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:39.100
<i>I'll still have to try!</i>

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.930
This is crazy, Popp!

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:42.180
Wait a minute!

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:44.730
But Popp is...

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.360
Popp is going to get killed!

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.570
Merle... you...

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:54.860
Here goes!

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.330
Crocodine!

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.910
I said leave this to me.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.670
But you can't win in that condition!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:11.090
I still have my left arm.
There's still hope.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:12.800
But...

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:18.760
Even if I lose both my eyes,
I'll still have my inner eye.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:22.060
The inner eye you helped clear.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:23.560
Me?

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.850
That's right.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.650
In that fight in Romos...

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:33.360
<i>you risked your life to face me,
someone you couldn't hope to beat.</i>

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:39.240
<i>You showed me the greatness
of humans, trusting and fighting together.</i>

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:45.210
The one who cleared
the filth staining my heart, Popp,

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.790
was you.

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:48.250
Big Guy...

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.130
That's why I risk my life, too!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:58.220
Baran may be unbeatable, but I can't
call myself your friend if I do nothing!

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.430
<i>Thanks, Big Guy.</i>

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:04.850
<i>But you don't have to die alone!</i>

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.640
<i>We die together!</i>

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:13.280
Here goes, Baran!
This will be my final attack!

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:19.530
Fool. Dodging an attack
from you now would be child's play.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:23.740
But I doubt you could dodge this.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.000
Gigabreak?!

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:31.960
I held back earlier against Dino,
but not this time.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:40.220
Former colleague or not, I won't let you
call humans great and live!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.510
W-What an aura of wrath!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.890
That was him holding back?!

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.350
I'll reduce both of you to ash!

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:00.860
It... It can't be!

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.540
Dai's back in action!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.040
What?!

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:14.920
I cast Fullheal! He's at full stamina!

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:23.640
And what difference will it make?!
I'll just blow you all away!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.430
Kazap!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.020
What?! Impossible!

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:37.530
Crocodine, look where I aim
and use that attack!

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.570
Got it!

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:43.780
Avan Strash!

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:47.040
Right there!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:53.250
Beast King Redemption Blast!

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.110
You did it!

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:19.650
Crocodine!

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.740
You're all right, Dai.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:24.620
Your eye. Did he get your eye?

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.660
This is nothing.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:30.910
Leona! We need you
to look at Crocodine's eye!

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.250
Got it!

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.000
Merle!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.710
It's all right. Just his eyelid was cut.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.300
What are you two still doing here?!

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.590
I wanted us to run.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:47.720
But this one insisted on helping you.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:52.180
I can do basic heal spells, too.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:55.690
You shouldn't!
Leave the healing to Leona and run!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:56.770
But...

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:59.400
Dai's right, young lady.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:00.230
Huh?

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:06.660
Maybe if it were someone else, but
we're fighting to world's strongest man.

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:10.540
Still, after being hit
by an attack like that...

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.540
I knew it!

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:20.380
He fully deployed his Draconic Aura
to protect his whole body!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.260
We're doomed!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.760
He's unhurt after taking both Avan Strash
and Beast King Redemption Blast...

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.640
What are we supposed to do?!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.470
No, it worked!

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:33.890
Blood?!

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:35.020
It's blood!

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.400
The same red blood that we have.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.690
What?!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:44.990
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:50.120
<i>They pierced my Draconic Aura
and damaged my body!</i>

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:54.790
<i>Even with help from his friends,
for such a small child...</i>

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.580
<i>But it wasn't just his power.</i>

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:01.380
<i>The power of his friends
had a large influence.</i>

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:06.380
<i>Dai's friends risked their lives
and did everything they could.</i>

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:12.100
<i>In turn, Dai's compassion for his friends,
made his heart multiply his power.</i>

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:18.310
<i>Unless that bond is broken,
Dai's power will continue to grow.</i>

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:22.190
<i>He may even be a threat to me eventually.</i>

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.440
He's coming!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:29.490
Crocodine, it looks like
our attacks had an effect!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.870
In that case...

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:35.200
Indeed. Either he falls or we do.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:38.210
We just fight on until we're spent!

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:41.670
Unfortunately, the same trick
won't work twice.

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:46.010
You won't avoid my Gigabreak
with such tricks again.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:50.590
But you never know.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:54.680
The boy holds terrifying potential.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:11:01.310
That is why I shall use all my focus
to take the source of Dai's power!

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:16.700
His Aura is gone?!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.620
What is he up to?!

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.300
What the...?!
My crest is acting on its own!

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.810
What the hell is that noise?!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:42.350
Their Dragon Crests are resonating!

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:51.860
BEAST KING REDEMPTION BLAST

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.870
GIGABREAK

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:03.130
M-My head... My head is splitting!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:07.880
Grampa Brass?!

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.260
What are you doing here?!

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:19.560
Gomechan... and everybody from the island?

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:29.480
Why is this all flashing in my mind?!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:41.790
Dai!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.460
Dai!

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:50.420
Baran, what have you done?!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:54.090
I've taken what my son no longer needs.

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:55.140
What?!

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:58.560
But I've used too much of my strength.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.390
I must retreat for now.

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:05.020
I shall return to reclaim Dino.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:11.150
Huh? Are we safe?

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.320
Dai!

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:14.740
Are you okay?

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:17.950
Man, what a relief!

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:21.330
What's wrong? You look dazed.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.420
Who... are you?

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:34.840
What am I doing here?

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:49.020
Why did Baran just leave?

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.610
He can't have given up.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.450
<i>I see.</i>

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:14.010
I got food, medicinal herbs,
and other things we might need.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:16.380
Thanks. It's a real help.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:19.890
But wasn't it hard
with the country in chaos?

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:22.390
It wasn't. It was the opposite.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:23.180
Huh?

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:27.520
Everyone was shut inside
or praying to the heavens.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.150
It was like the country was dead.

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:34.440
Seriously? After what just happened?

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:38.410
That's the sort of place Teran is.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:44.330
It's all people who know nothing
but to worship and pray to the gods.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.080
Who can blame them?

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:50.420
We'd like to do a little praying
of our own right now.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.550
How's it look, Princess?

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.670
Crocodine's eye should heal.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.760
But...

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:10.350
You're cute. What's your name?

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.860
Come here. Be my friend.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.780
What's wrong? Why are you crying?

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.280
It's total amnesia.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:25.240
No...

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:29.660
Baran said he took what Dai doesn't need.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.210
He meant Dai's memories as a human.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:37.920
Then that was some spell
that takes memories away?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:39.590
No it wasn't.

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:45.600
<i>It was probably an attack
using the resonance of Dragon Crests.</i>

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:49.890
<i>He focused all of his energy
and funneled it all into Dai's brain.</i>

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:57.150
Dai was too young to handle
Baran's massive energy and was blown away.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:03.700
As a result, Dai's memory was erased
leaving his mind a blank slate.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.580
Can he be cured?

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:07.990
I don't know.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:13.670
But right now, Dai is like an infant.
If Baran attacks us now...

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.420
Forget that!

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:23.300
What's more important is that
the memories of us in Dai's head is gone!

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:27.850
Tell me, Dai.
Do you really not remember anything?

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:29.850
Have you forgotten my face?

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:35.310
You all keep calling me "Dai."

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:37.900
Is that my name?

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.530
That's right! You're Dai!

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:44.990
You lived on Dermline Island with monsters
and you dreamed of being a future Hero!

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.910
And there... And there...

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:50.080
you met me!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.750
Dermline Island... Hero...

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.970
My head... hurts!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.220
Here. Put this on.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:14.640
Thank you, mister.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:24.450
Why you...! Have you even
forgotten my name, too?!

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:29.120
Even Master Avan who died to save us?!

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:29.990
Well?!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.080
It hurts! You're hurting me!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:33.540
Popp, stop it!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.960
That's enough, Popp!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.040
Come on!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:42.550
Here! Take this sword! And remember!

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.420
Remember your greatest attack!

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:49.140
No. I can't do that!

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:51.140
The hell you can't!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:57.900
You mastered Avan Strash! Something even
a genius like Hyunckel couldn't do!

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:01.070
Your brain may not remember,
but your body has to!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.360
No! Swords scare me!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:04.900
Do it! Do it now!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:08.410
Be it Earth Slash or Wave Slash...

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:11.490
Just do it!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:24.050
That man scares me! He's bullying me!

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:33.100
<i>It's hopeless.</i>

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:36.480
<i>With Dai like this...</i>

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:39.230
<i>when Baran attacks again...</i>

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.110
<i>we'll be powerless!</i>

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.650
Popp...

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.040
Let's go, Dai.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:58.670
Huh?

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.380
Where the hell is Baran?!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:06.300
Not only did he fail to capture Dai,
he hasn't reported back!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:09.680
I knew we couldn't leave this to him!

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.890
No, that was a brilliant move.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:19.640
To cut the bond between Dai
and his friends and render him useless.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:21.270
And now it's...

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.980
checkmate.

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:26.480
The next battle will be one to see.

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:31.490
I'm sure Baran will gather
all the forces he can.

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:33.990
You mean...

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.330
Alert! Alert!

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:38.580
Baran has been located!

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:39.660
Where?!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:46.420
The southern tip of Bengarna Kingdom.
He's been recuperating at Argo Point.

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.010
What is he doing now?

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:49.670
Showing now.

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:55.600
What are those three colored bonfires?

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.980
He's summoning the Dragon Masters.

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.310
What are they?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:08.190
Baran is unmatched even when using
Dragons alone, so it's not widely known,

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:13.360
<i>but he has three powerful servants
called the Dragon Masters.</i>

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:18.410
I summon you, masters of the Three Fields.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:22.460
It is time for the Dragon Legion
to go to battle!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:28.500
The Dragon Masters are

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:33.550
powerful Dragon Riders
who control Dragons of land, sea, and sky.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:40.600
When they gather under Baran, their
destructive power defies imagination.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:43.020
He controls such servants?

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.270
He's pulling out all the stops.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:50.990
So much for your chances, Hadlar.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.160
There you are, Dragon Masters.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:11.090
Member of the Dragon Masters,
Sky Rider Galdandy is here!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:25.440
King of the Sea,
Sea Rider Borahorn has arrived!

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:38.620
Land Rider Larhart at your service.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:46.000
We await your command.

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:15.240
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:15.240
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:22.240
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:22.240
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:25.460
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:25.460
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:33.420
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:33.420
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:35.970
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:35.970
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:36.130 --> 00:22:42.100
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:36.130 --> 00:22:42.100
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:46.770
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:46.770
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:50.980
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:50.980
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:57.450
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:57.450
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:03.280
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:03.280
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:08.580
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:08.580
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:26.310
<i>The three Dragon Masters
gather under Baran.</i>

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:30.350
<i>Together with Baran, they head
to Teran Kingdom to reclaim Dai.</i>

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:32.940
<i>Meanwhile, Dai remains without his memory.</i>

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:36.570
<i>The panic and uncertainty
creates cracks among his friends.</i>

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:38.860
<i>Baran and the Dragon Masters
advance without mercy.</i>

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:42.320
<i>But one man makes his way toward them.</i>

00:23:42.820 --> 00:23:45.080
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:46.990
<i>"The Dragon Masters Approach!"</i>

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:49.120
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
